  "description": "Could we… have been happy?\n\nAfter quitting his hellish job, Ji-won An throws himself into developing a game. Without even realizing it, he creates a character who looks exactly like the friend he secretly loved. But no matter how hard he tries, he can’t think of an ending.\n\nOne night, while rewriting the story, Ji-won falls asleep and wakes up inside the very world he created. And there, he encounters someone all too familiar…\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/govlflvmf), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/replay_until_happyending)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/govlflvmf)",
